    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 2479cb5414004e15af228ac5db107478
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A spitter (acid lobber, grenadier — any faction): keeps 9–14 m off, from bush to bush, and lobs its kit grenade (EnemyData › Kit › Grenade: an acid glob) every few seconds, moving to another bush in between so its target rarely knows which one it is in. Backs off from anything within 6 m.'
